WEBVTT

00:16:58.452 --> 00:17:01.503
Actually, in those experiments
that you were just talking about

00:17:01.527 --> 00:17:02.868
with the children,

00:17:02.892 --> 00:17:08.811
these were longitudinal studies
where scientists started with babies,

00:17:08.835 --> 00:17:12.858
and they exposed them to sugar water,
which is a kind of stimulation.

00:17:12.882 --> 00:17:15.583
And they found that the babies
with a nervous system

00:17:15.607 --> 00:17:18.360
that reacts more in response
to the sugar water,

00:17:18.384 --> 00:17:21.520
as they grow older,
tend to be more reactive

00:17:21.544 --> 00:17:23.366
to all different kinds of stimulation,

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.872
including social stimulation.

00:17:24.896 --> 00:17:27.041
They take the same sugar water babies,

00:17:27.065 --> 00:17:30.684
put them in a playgroup of kids
they've never seen before at age two,